  "turn": 1,
  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "I found TX-0401 in your account ACC-1005. The amount is **EUR 240.00**, paid by card to **TechMart Online** on 2026-07-20. The status is settled.\n\nI also see a second charge with the same merchant and amount: **TX-0402**, EUR 240.00, on 2026-07-14. This may matter depending on what happened.\n\nBased on the records, these reason codes could apply to TX-0401:\n\n- **duplicate_charge**: This fits if you were charged twice for one purchase. TX-0402 looks like a possible match, so this code is worth considering first if you only made one order.\n- **unauthorized_debit**: This fits if you did not authorise the payment and did not make the purchase.\n- **fraud_card_not_present**: This fits if someone used your card details for an online payment without your permission. TechMart Online was an online card payment.\n- **goods_not_received**: This fits if you paid for goods that never arrived.\n- **service_not_rendered**: This fits if you paid for a service that was not provided.\n\nTell me which situation matches what happened. I will then check whether a dispute can be opened before taking any action. I have not opened anything.",
